<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Brasmotor '96 net 127.9 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Brasmotor '96 net 127.9 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian home appliance manufacturing group Brasmotor issued the following statement on its 1996 preliminary results:</p>
<p>			    1996</p>
<p>    net profit	127.972 million</p>
<p>    net worth	 620.500 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais under the corporate law accounting method. No comparative data were provided.</p>
<p>--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 5511 2485412))</p>
